# Frontend UI

- Customer routes live under `src/app/(pages)/(main-pages)/`; owner routes live under `(private-routes)/` with `onboarding` and `dashboard`.
- Owner dashboard phase-8 surfaces: `/dashboard/catalog`, `/dashboard/staff-services`, `/dashboard/schedules` for catalog, staff assignment, and schedules.
- Owner dashboard salon profile edit: `/dashboard/salon-info` («اطلاعات سالن»); `/onboarding` remains create/resume-draft only.
- Owner dashboard phase-9 surfaces: `/dashboard/finance` and `/dashboard/z-report`; customer wallet page `/wallet` must render real balance/transactions.
- Owner dashboard phase-10 surfaces: `/dashboard/payouts` and `/dashboard/notifications`; customer notifications at `/notifications`.
- Never add platform admin UI to this SPA; admin surface is explicitly deferred/out of scope.
- Use `RouteAddress` for navigation; keep bottom nav customer-only unless adding an owner shell.
- Icons: `@phosphor-icons/react` or `lucide-react` — never `@radix-ui/react-icons` (not installed).
- Preserve existing dark theme tokens (`bg-surface-*`, `text-content-*`, primary green).
- Money = Toman; dates = Jalali in UI, `yyyy-MM-dd` / ISO toward the API.
- Do not ship mock identity, fake businesses, or crypto-style wallet placeholders when wiring real APIs.
